6.  Permitted Purpose

Any noncommercial purpose is a permitted purpose.

7.  Termination

Your license terminates automatically if you breach any of its conditions.
If your license terminates, you must stop all use and distribution of the
software and destroy all copies.

8.  No Liability

***As far as the law allows, the software comes as is, without any warranty
