9.  Definitions

"Software" means the software the licensor makes available under these terms.

"Commercial purpose" means any purpose intended for or directed toward
commercial advantage or monetary compensation.

"You" means the individual or entity exercising rights under these terms.

"Licensor" means the individual or entity offering the software under
